ow under  uh two thousand dollars will get you all  the hardware that you need and we do all  different variant and genotype calling  um using bayesian statistics uh and  calculate p values and that's all done  up front in the assembler  and you know we get uh can enrich our  reporting with dd snip and cosmic incur  vcf files custom files that you may have  you know you can import those as well  as well as gene files that contain  important gene lists and and we can  compare the variants you know at all  different scales it can be a couple of  samples hundreds of samples  it's easy to use and you know i'd  certainly recommend trying out a demo  the software if you haven't already and  and  at this point i think i'd just be happy  to take some questions  and  i can stick around here and and answer  any questions and if we don't have time  today we can certainly do questions uh  through email  thank you  you
 

